{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012BHwwaVProLkRxFVk9UwMX","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515/projects/meta_brain_lora_routing/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 8\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 10:32 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 定义为 Phase 0 early-kill gate：验证 π₀ 内部激活能否分类 3 类扰动（>70% 准确率）\\\\n  rationale: IDEA_BRIEF 提出的 Phase 0 方案是正确的 MVP 选择：(1) 整个方法论依赖\\\\\\\"扰动类型可从 VLA 内部激活诊断\\\\\\\"这一前提，若此假设不成立，后续所有工作（LoRA\\\\n    bank、routing、CM）全部无效；(2) 仅需 ~20 H100-hrs，4 天内可得到 GO/NO-GO；(3) SAFE (NeurIPS 2025)\\\\n    用相同架构做 binary failure detection 达到 78% ROC-AUC，3-class 粗粒度分类理应可行但需验证；(4) 有明确的\\\\n    fallback：50-70% 增强输入，<50% pivot 到 universal LoRA+CM。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 10:36 UTC\\\\n  summary: 采纳 Reviewer 4 条建议增强 Phase 0：+binary sanity check, +6-class 对照, +confusion\\\\n    matrix, +明确 7→3 映射\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出：(1) SAFE binary detection 不能类比 3-class classification（anomaly\\\\n    detection 是更弱假设），加 binary 作 sanity check 成本近零但能区分\\\\\\\"激活提取有问题\\\\\\\"vs\\\\\\\"假设不成立\\\\\\\"；(2) 7→3 映射未定义会导致实验不可复现且映射选择影响难度；(3)\\\\n    70% accuracy 不够——30% 误路由可能 worse than no routing，confusion matrix 能暴露具体风险。所有增强不影响\\\\n    Phase 0 核心设计和资源估算。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 10:44 UTC\\\\n  summary: Phase 0 架构修正：层索引改为 Gemma 2B 的 18 层范围 + 排除 Language Instructions + 增加 Action\\\\n    Expert 探针\\\\n  rationale: Worker 调研确认 π₀ 用 PaliGemma (Gemma 2B, 18 层)，非 32 层模型。IDEA_BRIEF 的 layers\\\\n    {4,8,12,16,20,24,28,32} 中后 4 个不存在，修正为 PaliGemma {2,4,6,8,10,12,14,16} + Action\\\\n    Expert {2,6,10,14}。排除 Language Instructions：Meta-Brain 的 LoRA 修正作用于 visual/action\\\\n    token representation，语言扰动（指令改写）影响的是文本输入而非表征空间，不在修正范围内。增加 Action Expert 探针：π₀ 有独立的\\\\n    Action Expert Transformer (1024-dim, 18 layers)，physical perturbation 可能在 action\\\\n    token 中有更强信号，低成本高信息量。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 15:40 UTC\\\\n  summary: Phase 0 GO — 核心假设验证通过，进入 Phase 1 LoRA expert 训练\\\\n  rationale: Phase 0 全部 GO 条件远超阈值：3-class macro-F1=0.993 (阈值 0.70)，binary ROC-AUC=1.0\\\\n    (阈值 0.75)，max off-diag=0.024 (阈值 0.30)。Few-shot K=1 单次前向传播 macro-F1=0.898（Visual\\\\n    子类），paligemma_layer_6 单层 K=1=1.0。核心结论：(1) π₀ 内部激活编码了充分的扰动类型信息；(2) 单次前向传播即可路由，无需等待多步；(3)\\\\n    PaliGemma layer 6 单层即可，路由器几乎零延迟。架构指导：router 仅挂载 PaliGemma 分支，LoRA experts 作用于\\\\n    PaliGemma 层。残留数据缺口（objects_layout/robot_initial_states per_step + sensor_noise）不影响\\\\n    GO 结论——episode-level 3-class 已证明三大类高度可分，Visual 子类 few-shot 是更难的任务。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase0_activation_collection\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 3-class 99.3%, binary AUC 1.0, K=1 F1 0.898, layer_6 K=1 1.0\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n  - D002\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 15:47 UTC\\\\n  summary: 进入 Research 阶段 — 完成 paper_framing.md + experiment_plan.yaml + 启动 Dream\\\\n    模拟\\\\n  rationale: 'MVP Phase 0 通过 (F1=0.993, K=1=0.898)。按 post-mvp-kickoff 流程: 写完 framing\\\\n    (3 Core Claims) + plan (12 experiments, 185 GPU-hrs) + 启动 dream_simulate(full)\\\\n    验证整套 plan。Dream 回调后批准 P0 实验。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase0_activation_collection\\\\n    role: basis\\\\n    result: GO — F1=0.993, K=1=0.898\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 16:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: PAR Router 改用 first-token pooling（F1 1.000 vs mean pooling 0.978）\\\\n  rationale: 完整 3-class few-shot (151 samples, 5-fold CV) 显示 first-token pooling K=1\\\\n    达到完美 F1=1.000，优于 mean pooling 的 0.978。PaliGemma 首 token 单独编码了足够扰动信息，无需对整个序列做 mean\\\\n    pool。简化计算且性能更优。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase0_activation_collection\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: first-token K=1 F1=1.000, mean K=1 F1=0.978\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 16:58 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dream 审稿 4-5/10 Reject — 修复 plan 加入 rank-48 control + rank sweep + clean\\\\n    eval，批准 plan_002 先行启动\\\\n  rationale: Dream 三档一致 Reject (best 4-5, median 5, worst 4)。核心问题：(1) 缺 rank-48 parameter-matched\\\\n    universal LoRA，(2) 缺 random routing，(3) bibliography 太薄，(4) VLA-GSE 跨 backbone\\\\n    比较误导，(5) worst 建议 rank sweep 验证 capacity bottleneck。已加 plan_013 (rank-48)、plan_014\\\\n    (rank sweep)、plan_015 (clean eval)，修复 framing (VLA-GSE 降级、contribution 合一、CM 降级)。plan_002\\\\n    (LoRA 训练) 在所有场景中都需要——即使 routing 无效也需要 expert cross-eval 数据——因此先行批准。re-dream 稍后并行启动验证修复后的\\\\n    plan。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase0_activation_collection\\\\n    role: basis\\\\n    result: GO\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4125, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_016xH4KfuHaHHSJe4YFCJzHk","session_id":"d09a97eb-2874-493a-b7bd-2546bcb68a45","uuid":"b5a1619f-9450-4e80-a08d-b8d2bf8b8233","timestamp":"2026-05-15T18:11:19.323Z"}
